#: src/almuten.c:773 src/almuten.c:785 src/almuten.c:796 src/almuten.c:807
#: src/almuten.c:818 src/almuten.c:829 src/almuten.c:844
msgid ""
"Spiritual Essence:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:774
msgid ""
"The soul seeks the expression of pure individuality, truth, and integrity.\n"
"There is an intrinsic calling to become a source of light, clarity, and\n"
"centrality for yourself and others.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:777 src/almuten.c:788 src/almuten.c:799 src/almuten.c:810
#: src/almuten.c:821 src/almuten.c:832 src/almuten.c:850
msgid ""
"Character Impact:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:778
msgid ""
"Confers natural nobility, personal magnetism, generosity, and a sharp\n"
"sense of destiny or mission. The native leads through dignified actions.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:780 src/almuten.c:791 src/almuten.c:802 src/almuten.c:813
#: src/almuten.c:824 src/almuten.c:837 src/almuten.c:856
msgid ""
"Evolutionary Hurdles:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:781
msgid ""
"Avoid the trap of excessive pride, egocentrism, vanity, or a neurotic\n"
"need for constant external validation and applause.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:786
msgid ""
"The spiritual path is realized through nurturing, cosmic alignment, and a\n"
"deep connection to the emotional tides of the world. The soul protects.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:789
msgid ""
"Grants extreme empathy, razor-sharp intuition, a bond with ancestry,\n"
"and a rich imagination. Highly adept at reading environmental atmospheres.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:792
msgid ""
"Mastering unstable mood swings, hypersensitivity, over-attachment to the\n"
"past, and a natural tendency to slide into passive dependency.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:797
msgid ""
"Evolution occurs via the intellect, the translation of reality, and the\n"
"unraveling of the laws that weave and connect all structural data.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:800
msgid ""
"Brings a brilliant mind, precise adaptability, and an elite talent for\n"
"the written or spoken word. An eternal learner and master problem solver.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:803
msgid ""
"Guarding against nervous system exhaustion, oscillating opinions,\n"
"intellectual duplicity, and a tendency to rationalize true emotions.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:808
msgid ""
"The soul seeks beauty, balance, absolute justice, love, and the sacred\n"
"reconciliation of opposites. Growth mirrors through deep relationships.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:811
msgid ""
"Confers authentic charm, innate diplomacy, refined aesthetic taste, and\n"
"magnetic attraction. You attract assets, art, and peace with comfort.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:814
msgid ""
"Evading superficiality, self-indulgence, a chronic fear of confrontation\n"
"(which breeds false diplomacy), and codependency.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:819
msgid ""
"The soul refines itself through friction, righteous combat, courage,\n"
"and severing stagnant attachments. Vital force demands protection of the "
"weak.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:822
msgid ""
"Grants unyielding determination, executive focus, wild independence, and\n"
"pioneering drives. The native actively thrives under extreme pressure.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:825
msgid ""
"Channelling destructive wrath, chronic impatience, verbal aggression,\n"
"and the base impulse to act tyrannically or purely out of self-interest.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:830
msgid ""
"The journey is bound to higher consciousness expansion, unwavering faith\n"
"in natural law, philosophy, and magnifying the spirit of benevolence.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:833
msgid ""
"Brings infectious optimism, a broad structural worldview, accidental luck,\n"
"and deep ethical codes. Acts as a natural, comforting counselor.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:839
msgid ""
"Controlling the slope toward excess (dogmatism, over-spending), naive\n"
"optimism that miscalculates physical danger, and intellectual arrogance.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:846
msgid ""
"The soul elected absolute mastery via self-discipline, heavy "
"responsibility,\n"
"the laws of time, hard boundaries, and wisdom etched directly into stone.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:852
msgid ""
"Confers exceptional sobriety, titanic resilience, strategic patience, and\n"
"pragmatism. Built to harvest true success and authority in maturity.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:858
msgid ""
"Avoiding chronic pessimism, paralyzing melancholy, fear of material "
"failure,\n"
"mental rigidity, and crushing yourself under unearned guilt.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:865
msgid "  [NARRATIVE END] - Press 'Q' or ESC to return to the Almuten panel.\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:932
msgid " Solar Return Almuten: Lord of the Year "
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:954
msgid " THE LORD OF THE YEAR (ALMUTEN OF SOLAR RETURN) \n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:957
msgid ""
"Unlike your Natal Almuten, which rules over your entire lifetime and soul "
"blueprint,\n"
"the Almuten of the Solar Return operates as the temporal manager of your "
"current year.\n"
"It indicates where the cosmic focus will manifest most intensely, driving "
"events,\n"
"circumstances, and the psychological tone of these specific 12 months.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:964
msgid ""
"CO-REGENCY DETECTED: Shared Annual Focus\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:966
msgid ""
"Two or more planetary archetypes share equal operational strength this "
"year.\n"
"Your experiences will be double-sided, forcing you to balance both planetary "
"themes\n"
"simultaneously to navigate the year's challenges effectively.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:978
msgid " ANNUAL OPERATIONAL RULER "
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:980
msgid "(THE SUN - ☉) \n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:981
msgid "(THE MOON - ☽) \n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:982
msgid "(MERCURY - ☿) \n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:983
msgid "(VENUS - ♀) \n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:984
msgid "(MARS - ♂) \n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:985
msgid "(JUPITER - ♃) \n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:986
msgid "(SATURN - ♄) \n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:992 src/almuten.c:1009 src/almuten.c:1020 src/almuten.c:1031
#: src/almuten.c:1042 src/almuten.c:1053 src/almuten.c:1068
msgid ""
"The Focus of the Year:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:994
msgid ""
"This is a year of high visibility, core awakening, and personal "
"sovereignty.\n"
"Circumstances will push you to step into the center stage of your own life,\n"
"demanding absolute clarity of purpose and professional recognition.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:998 src/almuten.c:1012 src/almuten.c:1023 src/almuten.c:1034
#: src/almuten.c:1045 src/almuten.c:1056 src/almuten.c:1074
msgid ""
"Practical Manifestations:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1000
msgid ""
"Expect opportunities for career promotion, leadership roles, and a surge in\n"
"vital energy. Important encounters with authoritative figures are highly "
"likely.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1003 src/almuten.c:1015 src/almuten.c:1026 src/almuten.c:1037
#: src/almuten.c:1048 src/almuten.c:1061 src/almuten.c:1080
msgid ""
"Annual Warnings:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1005
msgid ""
"Guard heavily against egotism, prideful power struggles, and burning out due "
"to\n"
"a neurotic need for constant public approval and validation.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1010
msgid ""
"A highly personal, internal, and emotional 12-month chapter. The focus "
"shifts\n"
"entirely toward foundations, family, domestic stability, and inner "
"security.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1013
msgid ""
"Strong indicators of real estate adjustments, changes in the household or "
"family\n"
"dynamics, and events that will test and restructure your emotional "
"resilience.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1016
msgid ""
"Beware of volatile mood swings, hypersensitivity to external criticism, and "
"the\n"
"tendency to retreat into defensive, nostalgic isolation when friction "
"arises.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1021
msgid ""
"A year driven by intense mental activity, intellectual output, and "
"networking.\n"
"Your analytical skills and communication channels will be highly "
"accelerated.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1024
msgid ""
"Excellent periods for signing contracts, negotiating business deals, "
"academic\n"
"pursuits, writing, and multiple short-distance travels or structural moves.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1027
msgid ""
"High risk of nervous system exhaustion, acute mental anxiety, split focus, "
"and\n"
"the danger of over-rationalizing critical decisions that require emotional "
"depth.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1032
msgid ""
"A year designated for harmonic consolidation, financial focus, and "
"relationship\n"
"evaluations. The core theme is finding value, alignment, and social peace.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1035
msgid ""
"Favorable timelines for artistic endeavors, income enhancement, entering "
"strategic\n"
"alliances, and experiencing a profound growth in your active romantic life.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1038
msgid ""
"Watch out for financial extravagance, lazy self-indulgence, and avoiding "
"necessary\n"
"confrontations out of a codependent desire to keep up superficial "
"appearances.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1043
msgid ""
"A dynamic, highly friction-based, and action-heavy period. This year "
"demands\n"
"intense physical courage, independent initiatives, and cutting away dead "
"weight.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1046
msgid ""
"Overcoming major obstacles through raw effort, launch of independent "
"enterprises,\n"
"but also a strong indicator of physical expenditures and competitive "
"standoffs.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1049
msgid ""
"Prone to acute accidents due to rash haste, explosive outbursts of anger,\n"
"unnecessary litigations, and burnouts caused by operating in perpetual "
"survival mode.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1054
msgid ""
"The year of expansion, philosophical growth, and providential "
"opportunities.\n"
"A benevolent energy wraps around your efforts, granting a protective "
"buffer.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1057
msgid ""
"Financial expansion, legal resolutions rolling in your favor, publishing "
"success,\n"
"and meaningful long-distance journeys that broaden your entire existential "
"worldview.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1063
msgid ""
"Severe risk of over-expansion and arrogance. Blind, naive optimism that "
"ignores\n"
"material safety nets, leading to over-leveraging and ideological dogmatism.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1070
msgid ""
"A sobering year of evaluation, heavy duty, consolidation, and setting "
"limits.\n"
"Time demands that you build structure and account for real-world "
"responsibilities.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1076
msgid ""
"Hard, grinding work that yields long-term security, settling deep debts, "
"dealing\n"
"with administrative inheritances, and professional solidifications under "
"pressure.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1082
msgid ""
"Prone to chronic fatigue, paralyzing fear of failure, bouts of deep "
"melancholy,\n"
"and feeling crushed under structural delays or burdens that are not yours to "
"carry.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1089
msgid ""
"  [NARRATIVE END] - Press 'Q' or ESC to return to the Solar Return panel.\n"
msgstr ""

